Phantom archetype balance adjusted

 Summon Doppelganger card now costs 3 mana, instead of 4;
 The Phantom base attack has been strengthened;
 Cards that add combat skills to Phantom now do more damage;
 Trait a Tough Doppelganger giving the Phantom 125 Health now gives 150, which extends its existence on the battlefield for one more round.

